# AI Translated
#. TRN DRI_PRIME is an environment variable name and must stay as it is.
msgid ""
"On a computer with two GPUs, run OrcaSlicer on the discrete GPU instead of "
"the one that drives the display. Some Wayland systems cannot show frames "
"rendered on the other GPU, or fail to open the window at all. Turn this off "
"if the 3D view stays empty; if OrcaSlicer no longer starts, start it once "
"with DRI_PRIME=0 in the environment to get back here."
msgstr ""
"På en computer med to GPU'er skal OrcaSlicer køre på den dedikerede GPU i "
"stedet for den, der styrer skærmen. Nogle Wayland-systemer kan ikke vise "
"billeder gengivet på den anden GPU eller kan slet ikke åbne vinduet. Slå "
