msgid ""
"Name of the currently selected bed plate type (e.g. 'Textured PEI Plate', "
"'Smooth High Temp Plate')."
msgstr ""
"Navnet på den aktuelt valgte pladetype (f.eks. 'Textured PEI Plate', 'Smooth "
"High Temp Plate')."

# AI Translated
msgid "IDEX/IQEX active mode"
msgstr "Aktiv IDEX/IQEX-tilstand"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Name of the active IDEX/IQEX parallel print mode for this plate (e.g. "
"'primary', 'mirror', 'copy'). Empty string if IDEX/IQEX is not enabled."
msgstr ""
"Navnet på den aktive parallelle IDEX/IQEX-printtilstand for denne plade "
