msgid ""
"Estimated print time when printed in normal mode (i.e. not in silent mode). "
"Same as print_time."
msgstr ""
"Estimeret printtid ved print i normal tilstand (dvs. ikke i lydløs "
"tilstand). Samme som print_time."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Estimated print time when printed in normal mode (i.e. not in silent mode). "
"Same as normal_print_time."
msgstr ""
"Estimeret printtid ved print i normal tilstand (dvs. ikke i lydløs "
"tilstand). Samme som normal_print_time."

