# AI Translated
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"Enable full access for \"%s\"?\n"
"\n"
"Full access turns off permission auditing for this plugin: its file system, "
"network, process, thread and event permissions are no longer checked. The "
"plugin can read and write most files your user account can access, including "
"startup scripts, SSH keys and a writable OrcaSlicer installation. Modifying "
"startup or application files can let code run outside these checks. Direct "
"Python access to OrcaSlicer's configuration, secret, certificate and "
"install-state paths stays blocked, but subprocesses are not restricted. Full "
"access is not a sandbox.\n"
"\n"
"Only enable this for a plugin you trust."
msgstr ""
"Vil du aktivere fuld adgang for \"%s\"?\n"
"\n"
"Fuld adgang slår tilladelseskontrol fra for dette plugin: dets tilladelser "
"til filsystem, netværk, processer, tråde og hændelser kontrolleres ikke "
"længere. Pluginet kan læse og skrive de fleste filer, din brugerkonto har "
"adgang til, herunder opstartsscripts, SSH-nøgler og en skrivbar "
"OrcaSlicer-installation. Ændring af opstarts- eller programfiler kan lade "
"kode køre uden for disse kontroller. Direkte Python-adgang til CosmoSlices "
"stier for konfiguration, hemmeligheder, certifikater og "
"installationstilstand forbliver blokeret, men underprocesser er ikke "
"begrænsede. Fuld adgang er ikke en sandkasse.\n"
"\n"
"Aktivér kun dette for et plugin, du har tillid til."

