# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Out of date - the paint, the seams or the seam angle changed since this "
"unwrap was made. Press to unwrap again."
msgstr ""
"Forældet - malingen, sømmene eller sømvinklen er ændret, siden denne "
"udfoldning blev lavet. Tryk for at udfolde igen."

# AI Translated
