"The post-processing plugin is expected to modify the G-code file %2% in "
"place, but the G-code file was deleted.\n"
"Please check the plugin implementation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Efterbehandlingspluginet %1% mislykkedes.\n"
"\n"
"Efterbehandlingspluginet forventes at ændre G-code-filen %2% på stedet, men "
"G-code-filen blev slettet.\n"
"Kontroller pluginets implementering.\n"

# AI Translated
#, possible-boost-format
