"G-code-fil: %2%"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The printing task exceeds the limit, supporting a maximum of 6 printers."
msgstr ""
"Printopgaven overstiger grænsen. Der understøttes maksimalt 6 printere."

# AI Translated
msgid "Elapsed time:"
msgstr "Forløbet tid:"

# AI Translated
msgid "Estimated time:"
msgstr "Estimeret tid:"

# AI Translated
msgid "Remaining time:"
msgstr "Resterende tid:"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Precise wall]
msgid ""
"Precise wall\n"
"Did you know that turning on precise wall can improve precision and layer "
"consistency?"
msgstr ""
"Præcis væg\n"
"Vidste du, at aktivering af præcis væg kan forbedre præcisionen og "
"lagkonsistensen?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Sandwich mode]
msgid ""
"Sandwich mode\n"
"Did you know that you can use sandwich mode (inner-outer-inner) to improve "
"precision and layer consistency if your model doesn't have very steep "
"overhangs?"
msgstr ""
"Sandwichtilstand\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan bruge sandwichtilstand (indre-ydre-indre) til at "
"forbedre præcisionen og lagkonsistensen, hvis din model ikke har meget "
"stejle overhæng?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Chamber temperature]
msgid ""
"Chamber temperature\n"
"Did you know that OrcaSlicer supports chamber temperature?"
msgstr ""
"Kammertemperatur\n"
"Vidste du, at OrcaSlicer understøtter kammertemperatur?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Calibration]
msgid ""
"Calibration\n"
"Did you know that calibrating your printer can do wonders? Check out our "
"beloved calibration solution in OrcaSlicer."
msgstr ""
"Kalibrering\n"
"Vidste du, at kalibrering af din printer kan gøre underværker? Prøv vores "
"elskede kalibreringsløsning i OrcaSlicer."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Auxiliary fan]
msgid ""
"Auxiliary fan\n"
"Did you know that OrcaSlicer supports Auxiliary part cooling fan?"
msgstr ""
"Hjælpeblæser\n"
"Vidste du, at OrcaSlicer understøtter en ekstra delkølingsblæser?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Air filtration]
msgid ""
"Air filtration/Exhaust Fan\n"
"Did you know that OrcaSlicer can support Air filtration/Exhaust Fan?"
msgstr ""
"Luftfiltrering/udsugningsblæser\n"
"Vidste du, at OrcaSlicer kan understøtte luftfiltrering/udsugningsblæser?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:G-code window]
msgid ""
"G-code window\n"
"You can turn on/off the G-code window by pressing the <b>C</b> key."
msgstr ""
"G-code-vindue\n"
"Du kan slå G-code-vinduet til/fra ved at trykke på tasten <b>C</b>."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Switch workspaces]
msgid ""
"Switch workspaces\n"
"You can switch between <b>Prepare</b> and <b>Preview</b> workspaces by "
"pressing the <b>Tab</b> key."
msgstr ""
"Skift arbejdsområde\n"
"Du kan skifte mellem arbejdsområderne <b>Forbered</b> og "
"<b>Forhåndsvisning</b> ved at trykke på tasten <b>Tab</b>."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:How to use keyboard shortcuts]
msgid ""
"How to use keyboard shortcuts\n"
"Did you know that Orca Slicer offers a wide range of keyboard shortcuts and "
"3D scene operations?"
msgstr ""
"Sådan bruger du tastaturgenveje\n"
"Vidste du, at Orca Slicer tilbyder et bredt udvalg af tastaturgenveje og "
"handlinger i 3D-scenen?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Reverse on even]
msgid ""
"Reverse on even\n"
"Did you know that <b>Reverse on even</b> feature can significantly improve "
"the surface quality of your overhangs? However, it can cause wall "
"inconsistencies so use carefully!"
msgstr ""
"Vend på lige lag\n"
"Vidste du, at funktionen <b>Vend på lige lag</b> kan forbedre "
"overfladekvaliteten af dine overhæng markant? Den kan dog give uensartede "
"vægge, så brug den med omtanke!"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Cut Tool]
msgid ""
"Cut Tool\n"
"Did you know that you can cut a model at any angle and position with the "
"cutting tool?"
msgstr ""
"Skæreværktøj\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan skære en model i enhver vinkel og position med "
"skæreværktøjet?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Fix Model]
msgid ""
"Fix Model\n"
"Did you know that you can fix a corrupted 3D model to avoid a lot of slicing "
"problems on the Windows system?"
msgstr ""
"Reparer model\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan reparere en beskadiget 3D-model for at undgå mange "
"slicingproblemer på Windows-systemet?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Timelapse]
msgid ""
"Timelapse\n"
"Did you know that you can generate a timelapse video during each print?"
msgstr ""
"Timelapse\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan generere en timelapse-video under hvert print?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Auto-Arrange]
msgid ""
"Auto-Arrange\n"
"Did you know that you can auto-arrange all the objects in your project?"
msgstr ""
"Automatisk arrangering\n"
"Vidste du, at du automatisk kan arrangere alle objekterne i dit projekt?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Auto-Orient]
msgid ""
"Auto-Orient\n"
"Did you know that you can rotate objects to an optimal orientation for "
"printing with a simple click?"
msgstr ""
"Automatisk orientering\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan rotere objekter til en optimal orientering for print "
"med et enkelt klik?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Lay on Face]
msgid ""
"Lay on Face\n"
"Did you know that you can quickly orient a model so that one of its faces "
"sits on the print bed? Select the \"Place on face\" function or press the "
"<b>F</b> key."
msgstr ""
"Læg på flade\n"
"Vidste du, at du hurtigt kan orientere en model, så en af dens flader ligger "
"på printpladen? Vælg funktionen \"Placer på flade\", eller tryk på tasten "
"<b>F</b>."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Object List]
msgid ""
"Object List\n"
"Did you know that you can view all objects/parts in a list and change "
"settings for each object/part?"
msgstr ""
"Objektliste\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan se alle objekter/dele på en liste og ændre "
"indstillinger for hvert objekt/hver del?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Search Functionality]
msgid ""
"Search Functionality\n"
"Did you know that you use the Search tool to quickly find a specific Orca "
"Slicer setting?"
msgstr ""
"Søgefunktion\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan bruge søgeværktøjet til hurtigt at finde en bestemt "
"indstilling i Orca Slicer?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Simplify Model]
msgid ""
"Simplify Model\n"
"Did you know that you can reduce the number of triangles in a mesh using the "
"Simplify mesh feature? Right-click the model and select Simplify model."
msgstr ""
"Forenkl model\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan reducere antallet af trekanter i et mesh med funktionen "
"Forenkl mesh? Højreklik på modellen, og vælg Forenkl model."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Slicing Parameter Table]
msgid ""
"Slicing Parameter Table\n"
"Did you know that you can view all objects/parts on a table and change "
"settings for each object/part?"
msgstr ""
"Tabel over slicingparametre\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan se alle objekter/dele i en tabel og ændre indstillinger "
"for hvert objekt/hver del?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Split to Objects/Parts]
msgid ""
"Split to Objects/Parts\n"
"Did you know that you can split a big object into small ones for easy "
"colorizing or printing?"
msgstr ""
"Opdel i objekter/dele\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan opdele et stort objekt i små, så det er nemt at "
"farvelægge eller printe?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Subtract a Part]
msgid ""
"Subtract a Part\n"
"Did you know that you can subtract one mesh from another using the Negative "
"part modifier? That way you can, for example, create easily resizable holes "
"directly in Orca Slicer."
msgstr ""
"Træk en del fra\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan trække et mesh fra et andet med modifikatoren Negativ "
"del? På den måde kan du for eksempel nemt lave huller, der kan ændres i "
"størrelse, direkte i Orca Slicer."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:STEP]
msgid ""
"STEP\n"
"Did you know that you can improve your print quality by slicing a STEP file "
"instead of an STL?\n"
"Orca Slicer supports slicing STEP files, providing smoother results than a "
"lower resolution STL. Give it a try!"
msgstr ""
"STEP\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan forbedre din printkvalitet ved at slice en STEP-fil i "
"stedet for en STL?\n"
"Orca Slicer understøtter slicing af STEP-filer og giver glattere resultater "
"end en STL med lavere opløsning. Prøv det!"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Z seam location]
msgid ""
"Z seam location\n"
"Did you know that you can customize the location of the Z seam, and even "
"paint it on your print, to have it in a less visible location? This improves "
"the overall look of your model. Check it out!"
msgstr ""
"Placering af Z-søm\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan tilpasse placeringen af Z-sømmet og endda male det på "
"dit print, så det placeres et mindre synligt sted? Det forbedrer modellens "
"samlede udseende. Prøv det!"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Fine-tuning for flow rate]
msgid ""
"Fine-tuning for flow rate\n"
"Did you know that flow rate can be fine-tuned for even better-looking "
"prints? Depending on the material, you can improve the overall finish of the "
"printed model by doing some fine-tuning."
msgstr ""
"Finjustering af flowhastighed\n"
"Vidste du, at flowhastigheden kan finjusteres for endnu flottere print? "
"Afhængigt af materialet kan du forbedre den samlede finish af den printede "
"model ved at finjustere."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Split your prints into plates]
msgid ""
"Split your prints into plates\n"
"Did you know that you can split a model that has a lot of parts into "
"individual plates ready to print? This will simplify the process of keeping "
"track of all the parts."
msgstr ""
"Opdel dine print i plader\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan opdele en model med mange dele i individuelle plader, "
"der er klar til print? Det gør det nemmere at holde styr på alle delene."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Speed up your print with Adaptive Layer Height]
msgid ""
"Speed up your print with Adaptive Layer Height\n"
"Did you know that you can print a model even faster by using the Adaptive "
"Layer Height option? Check it out!"
msgstr ""
"Print hurtigere med adaptiv laghøjde\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan printe en model endnu hurtigere ved at bruge "
"indstillingen Adaptiv laghøjde? Prøv det!"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Support painting]
msgid ""
"Support painting\n"
"Did you know that you can paint the location of your supports? This feature "
"makes it easy to place the support material only on the sections of the "
"model that actually need it."
msgstr ""
"Maling af understøtning\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan male placeringen af din understøtning? Denne funktion "
"gør det nemt kun at placere understøtningsmateriale på de dele af modellen, "
"der faktisk har brug for det."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Different types of supports]
msgid ""
"Different types of supports\n"
"Did you know that you can choose from multiple types of supports? Tree "
"supports work great for organic models while saving filament and improving "
"print speed. Check them out!"
msgstr ""
"Forskellige typer understøtning\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan vælge mellem flere typer understøtning? "
"Træunderstøtning fungerer godt til organiske modeller, sparer filament og "
"øger printhastigheden. Prøv dem!"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Printing Silk Filament]
msgid ""
"Printing Silk Filament\n"
"Did you know that Silk filament needs special consideration to print "
"successfully? A higher temperature and lower speed are always recommended "
"for the best results."
msgstr ""
"Print med silkefilament\n"
"Vidste du, at silkefilament kræver særlig omtanke for at blive printet godt? "
"En højere temperatur og lavere hastighed anbefales altid for at opnå de "
"bedste resultater."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Brim for better adhesion]
msgid ""
"Brim for better adhesion\n"
"Did you know that when printed models have a small contact interface with "
"the printing surface, it's recommended to use a brim?"
msgstr ""
"Brim for bedre vedhæftning\n"
"Vidste du, at det anbefales at bruge en brim, når printede modeller har en "
"lille kontaktflade med printoverfladen?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Set parameters for multiple objects]
msgid ""
"Set parameters for multiple objects\n"
"Did you know that you can set slicing parameters for all selected objects at "
"once?"
msgstr ""
"Angiv parametre for flere objekter\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan angive slicingparametre for alle valgte objekter på én "
"gang?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Stack objects]
msgid ""
"Stack objects\n"
"Did you know that you can stack objects as a whole one?"
msgstr ""
"Stabl objekter\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan stable objekter, så de samlet bliver ét?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Flush into support/objects/infill]
msgid ""
"Flush into support/objects/infill\n"
"Did you know that you can reduce wasted filament by flushing it into "
"support/objects/infill during filament changes?"
msgstr ""
"Skyl ud i understøtning/objekter/udfyldning\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan reducere spild af filament ved at skylle det ud i "
"understøtning/objekter/udfyldning under filamentskift?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Improve strength]
msgid ""
"Improve strength\n"
"Did you know that you can use more wall loops and higher sparse infill "
"density to improve the strength of the model?"
msgstr ""
"Øg styrken\n"
"Vidste du, at du kan bruge flere vægsløjfer og en højere tæthed af sparsom "
"udfyldning for at øge modellens styrke?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:When do you need to print with the printer door opened]
msgid ""
"When do you need to print with the printer door opened?\n"
"Did you know that opening the printer door can reduce the probability of "
"extruder/hotend clogging when printing lower temperature filament with a "
"higher enclosure temperature? There is more info about this in the Wiki."
msgstr ""
"Hvornår skal du printe med printerens dør åben?\n"
"Vidste du, at det kan mindske risikoen for tilstopning af ekstruder/hotend "
"at åbne printerens dør, når du printer filament med lavere temperatur ved en "
"højere kabinettemperatur? Der er flere oplysninger om dette i wikien."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Avoid warping]
msgid ""
"Avoid warping\n"
"Did you know that when printing materials that are prone to warping such as "
"ABS, appropriately increasing the heatbed temperature can reduce the "
"probability of warping?"
msgstr ""
"Undgå vridning\n"
"Vidste du, at når du printer materialer, der er tilbøjelige til at vride "
"sig, f.eks. ABS, kan en passende forhøjelse af varmepladens temperatur "
"mindske risikoen for vridning?"
